          Ödeme Sonrası Saniyeler İçinde İndirme
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
